&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Monitor participation and gather feedback&lt;/strong&gt; to measure engagement, identify key learnings and implement continuous improvements across learning programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Curate and structure learning content&lt;/strong&gt; by auditing existing AI, enablement and development resources and creating clear, audience-specific learning paths&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Develop practical learning resources&lt;/strong&gt;, including guides, FAQs, checklists and quick-reference materials, to facilitate knowledge sharing and support the adoption of new skills and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Support AI fluency initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; by collecting and documenting business use cases, designing surveys and knowledge assessments, and consolidating insights to inform People team decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Support the delivery of cross-functional People projects&lt;/strong&gt; across an international scope, including Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion, HRIS, HR process optimisation and culture-related initiatives in a fast-growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Coordinate stakeholders and contribute to project implementation&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment, follow-up and effective communication across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
