&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4099&quot; data-local-id=&quot;86ddbcf0793a&quot;&gt;Strong familiarity with GPU server platforms and tooling (for example: nvidia-smi, dcgmi, Linux logs correlation).&lt;/p&gt;
