&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 30 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is offering a unique opportunity to step into a newly created role and help shape the future of our global cloud operations. As our Programme Manager, Cloud Services DevOps, you&#39;ll oversee our enterprise-wide cloud services and infrastructure transformation initiatives. You will bridge the gap between high-level business strategy, financial planning and technical execution.&amp;nbsp;You will work across cross-functional engineering teams, manage delivery and governance, and optimize our continuous integration/continuous deployment (CI/CD) and cloud hosting environments (AWS/Azure).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programme &amp;amp; Delivery Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Ownership: Take full accountability for the delivery of complex cloud, infrastructure, and automation programmes from inception to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Reporting: Implement robust project governance, track budgets, manage RAID (Risks, Assumptions, Issues, Dependencies) logs, and report progress to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resource Allocation: Coordinate with onshore and offshore engineering teams, defining roles, workflows, and deliverables schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Facilitate communication between software development, IT operations, finance, security, and external clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; DevOps Oversight&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Strategy: Oversee the management and scaling of multi-cloud environments (AWS, Azure, or Private Cloud)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation &amp;amp; CI/CD: Ensure adherence to best practices in infrastructure-as-code (IaC) and automated deployment pipelines using tools like Terraform, Ansible, GitHub Actions, or Jenkins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Security: Embed security standards (DevSecOps), compliance requirements, and ITIL frameworks into the core delivery lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Optimization: Monitor platform reliability, uptime targets (SLAs), and logging/monitoring frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Required Skills and Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing enterprise-scale cloud transformation or DevOps programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background working in Agile, Waterfall, or hybrid delivery models within fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget management experience and familiarity with tracking toolsets (e.g., Azure DevOps, Jira, MS Project)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical competencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party vendor collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep conceptual or hands-on understanding of cloud architecture (SaaS, PaaS, IaaS, containerization/Kubernetes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipeline tools (Jenkins, GitLab CI, Azure DevOps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of infrastructure automation and configuration management tools (Terraform, Ansible)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Soft Skills and Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills to articulate technical solutions to non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and mentoring capabilities to guide engineering teams through operational change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1dfch1y&quot; data-start=&quot;216&quot; data-end=&quot;232&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;321&quot;&gt;Lead the team that proves our AI silicon performs reliably before it reaches customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;323&quot; data-end=&quot;527&quot;&gt;You will build and lead Graphcore&#39;s characterisation capability for next generation silicon and system platforms. Your work will help ensure our products perform consistently across real world conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;529&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot;&gt;You will define bring up and characterisation strategies, lead technical execution, and shape the lab infrastructure needed for success. You&#39;ll work across silicon, hardware, manufacturing, architecture and product teams to solve complex engineering challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;792&quot; data-end=&quot;927&quot;&gt;This is a hands on leadership role with the opportunity to influence both product design and how Graphcore validates future AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1pc0zxi&quot; data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;The team and culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;954&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;This is a newly formed team within Manufacturing Operations. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to establish how the team works while building strong partnerships across engineering and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1343&quot;&gt;Day to day, you&#39;ll work closely with architecture, silicon, hardware, production test and product teams. Decisions are driven by data, technical evidence and close collaboration across disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;We value ownership and clear communication. You&#39;ll be trusted to lead technical direction, remove blockers and help teams make progress with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;hsl8wh&quot; data-start=&quot;1499&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Essential&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cwxr2j&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;181&quot;&gt;Proven track record of delivering complex technical projects as an individual contributor, manager, or project manager, with the ability to work independently and drive execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bbmz19&quot; data-start=&quot;182&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in silicon digital device design, bring-up, characterisation, and silicon process technologies, with an understanding of their impact on transistor- and system-level performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1af93xd&quot; data-start=&quot;380&quot; data-end=&quot;535&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of high-performance processors, system-on-chip (SoC) architectures, and high-speed digital interfaces such as PCIe, Ethernet, and DDR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;88mybm&quot; data-start=&quot;536&quot; data-end=&quot;719&quot;&gt;Experience with measurement automation, data analysis, and scripting/coding to develop automated test and analysis workflows, with familiarity of ATE systems and their capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i7iazr&quot; data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills, supported by a bachelor&#39;s degree (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;20&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Knowledge of PCBA and system level technologies.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;11&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;20&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Project management experience.  &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;hsl8wh&quot; data-start=&quot;1499&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s6bpph&quot; data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2135&quot;&gt;Unlimited annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xdcm9g&quot; data-start=&quot;2136&quot; data-end=&quot;2162&quot;&gt;Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9i84tx&quot; data-start=&quot;2163&quot; data-end=&quot;2210&quot;&gt;Phantom equity – share in Graphcore&#39;s success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;29x8ds&quot; data-start=&quot;2211&quot; data-end=&quot;2255&quot;&gt;True flexibility in how and where you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18jz13s&quot; data-start=&quot;2256&quot; data-end=&quot;2298&quot;&gt;Office spaces designed for collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ywp1yb&quot; data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2333&quot;&gt;Free food and an on-site barista&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vtixha&quot; data-start=&quot;2334&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;Health cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pdwmtk&quot; data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2372&quot;&gt;Income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4nbmbl&quot; data-start=&quot;2373&quot; data-end=&quot;2389&quot;&gt;Life assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;150wh0j&quot; data-start=&quot;2390&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;Along with other benefits you can choose from (private medical insurance, dental plan etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2632&quot;&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2634&quot; data-end=&quot;2846&quot;&gt;We&#39;re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know. We&#39;re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;48xncx&quot; data-start=&quot;2848&quot; data-end=&quot;2877&quot;&gt;Join the team at Graphcore&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2879&quot; data-end=&quot;3119&quot;&gt;Graphcore is building the compute platform for the next generation of artificial intelligence. From advanced silicon to intelligent software, our technology is designed to unlock breakthroughs in AI and bring its benefits to every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3121&quot; data-end=&quot;3413&quot;&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, we&#39;re backed by one of the world&#39;s most ambitious technology investors, working alongside companies shaping the future of AI. Together, we share a bold goal: to help enable artificial superintelligence and ensure it delivers meaningful impact at a global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3415&quot; data-end=&quot;3865&quot;&gt;At Graphcore, you&#39;ll work with people who are pushing the boundaries of what&#39;s possible. Our teams bring together AI researchers, chip designers, software engineers and systems experts from a wide range of backgrounds. It&#39;s an environment where we take on big challenges with curiosity and focus, move quickly and decisively, take real ownership of our work, and speak up to challenge ideas, stepping up to support each other and lead through action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3867&quot; data-end=&quot;4064&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you want to lead the team that validates the technology powering the next generation of AI systems, we&#39;d love to hear from you. Apply now to join Graphcore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3867&quot; data-end=&quot;4064&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;isPasted&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metrea delivers effects-as-a-service to national security partners across five domains and more than a dozen mission areas. These include airborne ISR, electronic warfare, secure communications, aerial refueling, special air missions, aerial firefighting, and advanced simulation. We own the whole stack: designing, building, and operating turnkey capabilities that give our partners decisive, asymmetric advantage against rapidly evolving threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our operating model is built around three interlocking pillars. The Support Groups provide a global shared-service – spanning people, finance, platform, operations, legal, and engagement. This frees up our Core Groups, who develop and own mission capabilities end-to-end, to focus entirely on delivery. The Market Groups apply a regional lens, ensuring that our agile and adaptable capabilities remain aligned to the wicked problems that matter most to our partners across the Americas, EMEA, and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of our model is a simple but powerful idea: be a true partner with skin in the game. Our partners need effects, not just equipment. By owning the full stack – from the lab to the field – we are able to drive a continuous cycle of innovation that keeps our partners ahead. It&#39;s a fast-moving, intellectually demanding environment where talented people are given real responsibility, work on problems that matter, and contribute to an enterprise that is growing quickly and deliberately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Washington, DC, with facilities across the United States, the United Kingdom, as well as Continental Europe and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;We are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;seeking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; a highly accountable, hands-on Senior Staff Accountant to join our finance team. Reporting to the European Financial Controller, this role will take ownership of the day-to-day accounting and transactional activities for assigned Capability Units&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; (including one &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;located&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; in Germany)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;, ensuring finance processes are completed accurately, consistently, and on time. Responsibilities include managing the month-end close, financial analysis, budgeting, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;forecasting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; and reporting, as well as sales invoicing and purchase invoice processing across the full transaction lifecycle. The successful candidate will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;demonstrate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; a strong ownership mindset, proactively resolving issues, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;maintaining&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;high standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;, and operating &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;effectively without close supervision. This role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;provides&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; an excellent opportunity for career progression, with support available toward a professional accounting qualification such as ACCA or CIMA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW104610946 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Prepare monthly management accounts for assigned capability units/files, including income statements, balance sheets, and cash flow forecasts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Own the month-end and year-end close for assigned capability units/files, including journal entries, accruals, reconciliations, and ensuring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;accurate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;timely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; recording of financial transactions &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;in accordance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; US GAAP and local statutory requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Review transactions to ensure proper accounting treatment and allocation of expenses to various capability units/files&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Verify proper recording of intercompany transactions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Own all transactional finance processes for assigned Capability Units, including sales invoicing, purchase invoice processing, expense verification, and weekly payment runs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Collaborate with peers across the business, acting as the primary finance point of contact for assigned Capability Unit, coordinating effectively with domestic and international stakeholders (including USA and Germany), as well as European accounting and tax offices &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Assist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; with annual financial statements audits, prepare supporting schedules and documentation, and responding promptly to audit queries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Provide relevant information for tax filings, and collaborate with the Financial Controller to ensure compliance with local filing obligations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Assist the European Business Partner in developing annual budgets and periodic forecasts, as well as in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;maintaining&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; financial models to support decision-making and resource allocation within the capability units/files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the finance team on improvements in financial processes and reporting efficiency across the organisation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Assist the Business Partner and the Financial Controller with ad hoc reporting and financial analysis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Demonstrate eagerness and enthusiasm to learn, grow, and adapt within a rapidly evolving enterprise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
